title: The Central Executive Committee
subtitle: Once a year PPS fills the three seats of its Committee.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_advisers.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.ckwAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.ckw (Z — 1.42, decision K1A of 28 XI 2026, reworked the same day): once a year the three seats of the Committee; for each
// seat the player picks a current and the current names the person. It replaced the composition card with its list of candidates
// and the actions of the members. Confirming the composition is the month's decision; the card rests a year.
PolishParty.ckwView(Q, true);
!}

= The Central Executive Committee

The Committee now consists of [+ pl_ckw_now +]. For each of its three seats we choose a current, and the current names its candidate; a current that gains seats grows stronger and calmer, and one that loses them is displeased.

- @centrum
- @lewica
- @pilsudczycy
- @keep
- @easy_discard

@compose
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwView(Q, false);
!}

= The new Committee

[+ pl_ckw_draft_text +] [+ pl_ckw_left_text +]

- @centrum
- @lewica
- @pilsudczycy
- @confirm
- @restart
- @easy_discard

@centrum
title: [+ pl_ckw_title_centrum +]
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The moderate socialists of the Sejm and the unions.
view-if: pl_ckw_draft_n < 3
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.ckwSeatStatus(Q, 'centrum').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ckw_centrum_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwPick(Q, 'centrum');
!}
go-to: compose

@lewica
title: [+ pl_ckw_title_lewica +]
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The supporters of a clearer class politics.
view-if: pl_ckw_draft_n < 3
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.ckwSeatStatus(Q, 'lewica').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ckw_lewica_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwPick(Q, 'lewica');
!}
go-to: compose

@pilsudczycy
title: [+ pl_ckw_title_pilsudczycy +]
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The former fighters close to Piłsudski.
view-if: pl_ckw_draft_n < 3
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.ckwSeatStatus(Q, 'pilsudczycy').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ckw_pilsudczycy_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwPick(Q, 'pilsudczycy');
!}
go-to: compose

@keep
title: We keep the present Committee
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. Its currents calm a little.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.ckwConfirmStatus(Q, true).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ckw_keep_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwConfirm(Q, true);
!}
go-to: result

@confirm
title: We confirm the new Committee
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The currents that gain seats grow stronger and calmer, and those that lose them are displeased.
view-if: pl_ckw_draft_n = 3
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.ckwConfirmStatus(Q, false).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_ckw_confirm_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwConfirm(Q, false);
!}
go-to: result

@restart
title: We start again
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. The chosen seats are cleared.
view-if: pl_ckw_draft_n > 0
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.ckwReset(Q);
!}
go-to: compose

@result
new-page: true

= The Central Executive Committee

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
